{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "9133237e94a5129c920b307236c46a7c1bf817f511fdaf40ca171ff7c67cd589", "ja": "ドラマの撮影中", "zh": "戏剧拍摄中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4001_p", "source_sha256": "c10dc9eabc204a2d08c7d08b726369e1c53ca6fefc54c9fd6c625835d99564c8", "ja": "（今日はドラマの撮影だ。真美の役はゲストだが、\nセリフ量も多い……やりごたえがありそうだな！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄戏剧，真美虽然是客串的角色，\n但是台词很多……看来很有挑战性！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4002_012mam", "source_sha256": "b0238c45356846ae0494f683a659a23733a4a40b9ec6af2ea9772e18d112ea50", "ja": "兄ちゃんっ、ヘルプ真美ー！\n兄ちゃんのかわいい真美が、なんか超ピンチなの！", "zh": "大哥哥，救救真美──！\n大哥哥的可爱真美好像遇到了超级危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4003_p", "source_sha256": "039871cd0b904de858d3592173e199ab01644a52bd64af936af8862a589ae551", "ja": "……どうしたんだ？　間違ってセットでも壊したか？\nそれとも、セリフをど忘れしたのか？", "zh": "……怎么了？难道不小心把设备弄坏了？\n还是说，忘记台词了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4004_012mam", "source_sha256": "b6ab3be0e24991e788b92e316d5b758b9d2e86a6e9d715e89ea3844ae724ae7e", "ja": "ちがうよ～。ほら、今回の真美の役って、\nめっちゃゴーテーに住んでるお嬢様っしょ？", "zh": "不是啦～你看，真美这次的角色，\n是住在超级豪宅的大小姐对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4005_012mam", "source_sha256": "234328ee7449c28182653761123153d1b81c8d1bd0dff5761cef671cc7365957", "ja": "だからね、いおりんのマネしてみたんだけど……。\nマジメにやれって監督に怒られちゃったんだ～。", "zh": "所以呀，真美就模仿了伊织儿的样子……\n可是却被导演骂，要真美认真演～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4006_012mam", "source_sha256": "103e4c353579fcfab7803510e2bbfc4395c2aebd790b323b83c9981d8e5a6266", "ja": "絶対イケるって思ってたんだけど……。\nねえ兄ちゃん、真美、どうしたらいいの？", "zh": "真美本来以为绝对没问题的说……\n我说大哥哥，真美要怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4007_p", "source_sha256": "683ccfc8fc146f624744bfd192760aaa0fcf2784d5f674e4c00a6655283e41ae", "ja": "なるほど。そういう時は……。", "zh": "原来如此，这种时候就要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4008", "source_sha256": "d156917de117de0f4fa2fe2cf95029e812a45d1db3d5f7f6a61bc3c65505fe47", "ja": "監督と仲良く", "zh": "和导演打好关系", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4009", "source_sha256": "1d6a7ae74ef5b73fae7632de4b57c966098f1deec2a69a3ccdddf6ea8de83fbb", "ja": "役の仮面をかぶれ", "zh": "戴上角色的面具", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4010", "source_sha256": "511e97c99481c1fe754c7daa541fdf2d4d4e3e6ffe005e6c54dd2969ac72acd9", "ja": "まずは休憩", "zh": "先休息再说", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4100_p", "source_sha256": "e760240d7ebf3ca2bf5203ed85116a7adc4b5a48ed24c362800bda655e17c88f", "ja": "そういう時は、まず監督と仲良くならないと。\n真美は得意じゃないか。", "zh": "这种时候就得先和导演打好关系了。\n真美很擅长吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4101_012mam", "source_sha256": "e5a4442853b8c17508b0b63908b5fea9fb66c1ef59f2dd4f4379bc1929e30175", "ja": "うっ……真美、監督のおっちゃんに話しかけるのは\nちょびっとコワイんだけど……。", "zh": "呜……真美有点怕\n找导演大叔说话耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4102_012mam", "source_sha256": "92ddd80fe9eae64efcc583e1ae5477faf6564cdfab7b575ca67ae61c75335061", "ja": "でも、そうだよねー。仲良くなんないと、\nなんで怒ったのかも、よくわかんないし……。", "zh": "不过，说得也是──得去打好关系才行，\n不然真美也不清楚他为什么要生气啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4103_012mam", "source_sha256": "a8abdc6bfd962f8625d7476a2a9affc26c7900022d59498b1ecec6b529cf5825", "ja": "わかったよ兄ちゃん！　真美、今から監督のおっちゃん\nと、ハートをにぎりっこしてくるね！　バイキュー！", "zh": "真美知道了，大哥哥！\n真美现在就去和导演大叔交心！掰谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4104_p", "source_sha256": "de2a3d13c6643241f5e26aa42ea043cbf3b16b55daaa0e4543683d17a016f9d3", "ja": "（無事にいつもの真美に戻れたかな。\nこれで、監督とのイメージの共有も進むだろう！）", "zh": "（看来顺利变回平常的真美了。\n这样子，也能有助于她和导演交换想法吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4200_p", "source_sha256": "22e8836de87a6a91187c4eafcdc41d638b2e63d8a2899c2b4456291ce395cc1d", "ja": "そういう時は、演じる役の仮面をかぶるんだ。", "zh": "这种时候，就要戴上饰演角色的面具。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4201_012mam", "source_sha256": "b8ee2303d3f8406d2d91bc7374ba49a043b9cb1c03b3d46f7b69a92fbed98f16", "ja": "へ？　カメンをかぶれって……どゆこと？\nあ、正義のヒーローになれってこと！？", "zh": "欸？你说戴上面具……什么意思？\n啊，是要成为正义英雄的意思吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4202_p", "source_sha256": "4811f4c004ba4bd2971d4e8563fe9f824c8c10445452a972c46abdc2b37b5c98", "ja": "いや、自分とは違う人間になりきれって意味だよ。\n双海真美じゃなく、その役として行動してみるんだ。", "zh": "不对，意思是要彻底成为和自己不同的人。\n并非双海真美，而是把自己当成那个角色来行动看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4203_012mam", "source_sha256": "76f5cbf4b72b01049c51aa75284c09f913a5133ab0b021e3c1a6dd631d7323da", "ja": "そっか、モノマネってことだね？\nわかったー！　ありがと、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "这样啊，就是模仿的意思吧？\n真美知道了──！谢谢你，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4204_p", "source_sha256": "e0420607e0305778fcaf797c106bd14f68c78584f1c60e72bc436470a8011972", "ja": "（まあ、方向性はイメージできそうだな。\nあとは真美自身に、演技を深めていってもらおう！）", "zh": "（看来她在角色形象上能找到方向了。\n之后就靠真美强化自身的演技吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4300_p", "source_sha256": "0673c1db26f31272eb7a433159b32779345d5d042302d97e220432a7d6bdb2aa", "ja": "あまり根を詰めすぎてもよくないからな。\nちょっと休憩して、対戦ゲームでもしようか？", "zh": "太钻牛角尖也不好。\n稍微休息一会，来打对战游戏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4301_012mam", "source_sha256": "a60c552a054a465c783accd4f3b0748d03538d2d73f328847836717f794380a0", "ja": "兄ちゃん……マジメに考えてよ～。\nアイドルって、そんな甘いモンじゃないっしょ？", "zh": "大哥哥……你认真思考啦～\n偶像才不是那么简单的工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_4302_012mam", "source_sha256": "6fd817b3b00f7c64cff57ba7ce3b5c6a35ec2f7829480f42d50970614068d721", "ja": "といいつつ、意外と甘いモンだったりもするよね？\nねね、どれで遊ぶ？", "zh": "说是这么说，但说不定意外地简单？\n欸欸，要玩什么游戏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
